OL,3,GNEWSAGirl dies after crash involving
OL,4,Avan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA girl has died following a crash
OL,7,Finvolving a van.
OL,9,FDurham Police said a Fiat 500 carrying
OL,10,Fthe girl and a Ford Transit van
OL,11,Fcollided on Shincliffe Lane, near
OL,12,FDurham, at about 17:30 BST on Thursday.
OL,14,FIt said the girl, whose age it did not
OL,15,Fprovide, was declared dead at the scene
OL,16,Fdespite efforts to save her life.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
