OL,3,GNEWSAGirl dies after crash involving
OL,4,Avan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second passenger in the Fiat was
OL,7,Ftaken to University Hospital North
OL,8,FDurham for treatment, the force said,
OL,9,Fadding that both vehicles' drivers
OL,10,Fsustained minor injuries. It said it
OL,11,Fwas appealing for witnesses.
